		<div class="explodable"><h4 class="exploHead">Description</h4><div class="exploBody"><span class="plainmeta">The Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory Telescope Data Center's TAP end point. The Table Access
Protocol (TAP) lets you execute queries against our database tables,
inspect various metadata, and upload your own data. It is thus the
VO's premier way to access public data holdings.</span>
<span class="plainmeta">Tables exposed through this endpoint include: data_public from the echelle schema, data_public from the fast schema, data_public from the hectochelle schema, data_public from the hectospec schema, obscore from the ivoa schema, m31 from the m31_proj schema, columns, groups, key_columns, keys, schemas, tables from the tap_schema schema.</span></div></div>
